================================================================================
Third-Party Design References & Attributions
================================================================================

moon_sf2 is a clean-room, pure MoonBit implementation with zero C FFI
dependencies. Its SoundFont2 synthesizer architecture, generator/envelope/LFO/
modulator semantics, and stereo effect algorithms draw architectural inspiration
from the following open-source projects:

1. sinshu/rustysynth
   Repository: https://github.com/sinshu/rustysynth
   License: MIT License

2. schellingb/TinySoundFont
   Repository: https://github.com/schellingb/TinySoundFont
   License: MIT License
